ness and color temperature to ensure perfect lighting in any environment or occasion.<\/p><p>Foldable Portable DesignThe foldable18-inch ring light comes with a lightweight tripod, the LED light and tripod combination is easy to carry and store, ideal for studio and outdoor shooting.<\/p><p>Adjustable HeightThe selfie ring light comes with a 62.4-inch adjustable tripod, providing flexible height and angle options to accommodate a variety of shooting settings and viewing angles.<\/p><p>Compatible with Multiple DevicesThe LED large ring light stand works seamlessly with DSLR cameras and mobile devices, making it a versatile choice for photography, videography, or live streaming, with a wide range of applications.<\/p><p>User-friendly OperationLED professional ring light can be easily controlled and adjusted with switches for brightness and temperature, making it a great choice for beginners and professionals.<\/p><p>Ideal for photographers, filmmakers, and content creators. Elevate your shoots today with this must-have largelight stand for ring light setup!<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["heading_PYUFrk","text_XxHkf6"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","content_alignment":"left","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed"}},"feature_list_cW3d9c":{"type":"feature-list","blocks":{"feature_item_VbCwL3":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style":"btn--secondary","text":"Free shipping"}},"feature_item_NzxQGa":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style":"btn--secondary","text":"Money Guarantee"}},"feature_item_yyNV9A":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style":"btn--secondary","text":"Flexible Payment"}},"feature_item_gBgLft":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style":"btn--secondary","text":"Online support"}},"feature_item_R8A8eX":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"